V\">\\(X,T,b\\in V\\)</span>，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(T\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S\\)</span>（有限集谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"07554a796c3aa1f5\" href=\"?note=07554a796c3aa1f5\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S\\)</span>（序列树分支谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4c8fda037173bed0\" href=\"?note=4c8fda037173bed0\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(u)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\land u{\\upharpoonright}\\operatorname{dom}(t)=t\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)\\coloneqq\\{u\\in T:\\operatorname{dom}(u)=\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\land u{\\upharpoonright}\\operatorname{dom}(t)=t\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FinitelyBranchingSeqTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{FinitelyBranchingSeqTree}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span>（定义于此）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}branching\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyBranchingSeqTree}_S(T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}finitely\\text{-}branching\\text{-}sequence\\text{-}tree}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyBranchingSeqTree}_S(T,X)\n\\leftrightarrow\nT\\subseteq X^{&lt;\\omega}\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\forall m\\in\\operatorname{dom}(t)+1\\;(t{\\upharpoonright}m\\in T)\n\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(\\operatorname{Succ}_T(t)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}koenigs\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyBranchingSeqTree}_S(T,X)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(T)\n\\to\\exists b\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\omega\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}koenigs\\text{-}lemma}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{FinitelyBranchingSeqTree}_S(T,X)\n\\land\\neg\\mathrm{ZfcCard6FiniteSet}_S(T)\n\\to\\exists b\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcFunBranchThroughTree}_S(b,T)\\land\\operatorname{dom}(b)=\\omega\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>这是“无限且有限分枝的有限序列树有无限分支”的形式。</li>\n<li>它与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ac1dcd0c905db534\" href=\"?note=ac1dcd0c905db534\" title=\"58-lem-konig\">58-lem-konig</a> 的“每层有限非空”形式等价，但前提包装方式不同。</li>\n<li>初段闭包和每个节点的直接后继集合都在本文件中按序列结构展开；这避免复用一个把类关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\subseteq\">\\(\\subseteq\\)</span> 传给集合关系参数的上游包装谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"4c8fda037173bed0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-fun-branch-through-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-zfc-card6-finite-set.md","status":"resolved","id":"07554a796c3a